COPY public.compliance_rules (id, name, description, obligation, source, condition_logic, category, priority, frequency, effective_from, effective_to) FROM stdin;
1	Employee Compliance Rule	Applies when the business is a Private Limited company with 100 or more employees	Example employee-related compliance obligation	Dummy source for development	AND	Employee	1	Annual	2025-04-01	\N
2	GST Registration Rule	Applies when the business is a Private Limited company with 100 or more employees	Example employee-related compliance obligation	Dummy source for development	AND	GST	1	Monthly	2025-04-01	\N
3	High Business Size Rule	Applies to businesses registered under GST	Example GST compliance obligation	GST Portal	AND	Business Size	2	Annual	2025-04-01	\N
4	EPF Coverage Threshold	Simplified development rule based on EPF provisions of the Code on Social Security, 2020 for establishments employing 20 or more employees	Check EPF applicability and registration requirements	Ministry of Labour and Employment - Code on Social Security, 2020	AND	Employee	1	Ongoing	2025-11-21	\N
